[
  {"comment": "Assembly paths (mitcad#1737) on the OCCT kernel. A: a 40 mm plate 10 mm thick below XY (F1) with a 10.2 mm hole through it (F2), and a 10 mm peg (F3) standing on the hole, 20 mm tall."},
