  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": "xy", "center": [20, 20], "diameter": 10,
    "height": 20, "operation": "new_body"}},

  {"comment": "B: the same plate beside it (F4, hole F5) and a peg (F6) with a sideways lug (F7, joined): 4 mm out from the peg's axis to 8 mm, 2 mm wide, its underside on the plate's top beside the hole."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": "xy", "corner": [0, 60], "length": 40, "width": 40,
    "height": -10, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": "xy", "center": [20, 80], "diameter": 10.2,
    "height": 30, "symmetric": true, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F4.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": "xy", "center": [20, 80], "diameter": 10,
    "height": 20, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": "xy", "corner": [24, 79], "length": 4, "width": 2,
    "height": 4, "operation": "join", "participants": ["F6.b0"]}},

  {"comment": "C: a hub plate (F8) with a 10.2 mm hole (F9) and a keyway 2.4 mm wide to 7.2 mm from the axis (F10), and a 10 mm shaft (F11) in it with a key 2 mm wide to 7 mm (F12, joined), both 10 mm long, the key centred in its keyway."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": "xy", "corner": [80, -20], "length": 40, "width": 40,
    "height": -10, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": "xy", "center": [100, 0], "diameter": 10.2,
    "height": 30, "symmetric": true, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F8.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": "xy", "corner": [104, -1.2], "length": 3.2, "width": 2.4,
    "height": 30, "symmetric": true, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F8.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": "xy", "center": [100, 0], "diameter": 10,
    "height": -10, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": "xy", "corner": [104, -1], "length": 3, "width": 2,
    "height": -10, "operation": "join", "participants": ["F11.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 6}},
  {"comment": "The bodies where they are: nothing overlaps (the lug only touches)."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "interference"}, "result": {"bodies": 6, "pairs": []}}},

  {"comment": "A: the peg slides 10 mm down through the hole 0.2 mm larger: no hit, 0.1 mm clearance all the way, every span ruled out by the clearances."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "assembly_path", "body": "F3.b0", "against": ["F1.b0"],
      "slide": {"direction": [0, 0, -1], "distance": 10}, "steps": 10}, "tolerance": 1e-4,
    "result": {"motion": "slide", "unit": "mm", "length": 10, "steps": 10, "hit": null,
      "touches_at_end": false, "certified": true,
      "min_clearance": {"clearance": 0.1, "closest": {"body": "F1.b0"}}}}},
  {"comment": "The direction as an axis reference: Z, the other way."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "assembly_path", "body": "F3.b0", "against": ["F1.b0"],
      "slide": {"direction": "z", "distance": -10}, "steps": 10}, "tolerance": 1e-4,
    "result": {"hit": null, "min_clearance": {"clearance": 0.1}}}},

  {"comment": "B: the lug resting on the rim: the peg goes no way down, the hit at the first step, with the plate."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "assembly_path", "body": "F6.b0", "against": ["F4.b0"],
      "slide": {"direction": [0, 0, -1], "distance": 10}, "steps": 10},
    "result": {"hit": {"step": 1, "at": 0, "at_start": false, "bodies": [{"body": "F4.b0"}]},
      "min_clearance": {"clearance": 0}}}},
  {"comment": "Lifted 5 mm it goes up freely."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "assembly_path", "body": "F6.b0", "against": ["F4.b0"],
      "slide": {"direction": [0, 0, 1], "distance": 5}, "steps": 5},
    "result": {"hit": null}}},

  {"comment": "C: the keyed shaft turned 0.1 rad about its axis from its key angle: the key's outer corner (7 mm out, 1 mm from the key's centre line) reaches the keyway's wall (1.2 mm from it) at asin(1.2 / sqrt(50)) - atan(1 / 7) = 0.0286339 rad (1.6406 deg), within the 0.01 rad step 3, with the hub (script tolerances are absolute below 1: 5e-5 rad here; the search resolves 0.0001 mm at the 8.6 mm reach of the shaft's box)."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "assembly_path", "body": "F11.b0", "against": ["F8.b0"],
      "turn": {"axis": {"origin": [100, 0, 0], "direction": [0, 0, 1]}, "angle": 0.1}, "steps": 10,
      "tolerance": 0.0001}, "tolerance": 5e-5,
    "result": {"motion": "turn", "unit": "rad", "length": 0.1,
      "hit": {"step": 3, "at": 0.0286339, "at_start": false, "bodies": [{"body": "F8.b0"}]}}}},
  {"comment": "Turned the other way it meets the other wall at the same angle."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "assembly_path", "body": "F11.b0", "against": ["F8.b0"],
      "turn": {"axis": {"origin": [100, 0, 0], "direction": [0, 0, 1]}, "angle": -0.1}, "steps": 10,
      "tolerance": 0.0001}, "tolerance": 5e-5,
    "result": {"hit": {"step": 3, "at": 0.0286339}}}}
]
